	&\hspace{30pt}\leqslant \frac1{\sqrt{2}} \cdot 2n_{r-1} \cdot \sqrt{s \cdot 2n_{r-1} \cdot 1/(\gamma_r + 1)} = 2 \cdot (n_{r-1})^{3/2} \cdot \sqrt{\frac{s}{\gamma_r + 1}}. \qedhere
