	Conditioned on $\ensuremath{\mathcal{E}_{\textnormal{cond}}}$, the joint distribution of all the random variables in the mutual information term are independent of the event $ \rid{-y_i} = K_j$. Let us list these random variables, and argue in steps (in each step, we condition on everything in the previous steps also). 
